       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI50102.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI50102.
      *
      *     Consulta de Mensagens
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI50102         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8101 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5010.
       COPY SWCV5011.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
      *
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT8101 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8101'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME            PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI50102'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI50102         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5010-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5010-ASE               TO SWCV5011-ASE.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5010-ADE               TO SWCV5011-ADE.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2100-OBTEM-DADOS
                 THRU 2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-OBTEM-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-OBTEM-DADOS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-OBTEM-DADOS'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SWCV5010-CCHAVE '      TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE SWCV5010-CCHAVE         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              MOVE 'SWCV5010-ZMSGORD'      TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(2)
              MOVE SWCV5010-ZMSGORD        TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5010-CCHAVE            TO SWCD8101-CCODMSG.
           MOVE SWCV5010-ZMSGORD           TO SWCD8101-ZMSGORD.

           EXEC SQL
                 SELECT
                       CCODMSG
                     , ZMSGORD
                     , GMSG
                     , ILIDO
                     , CPERFILC
                     , CUSERIDC
                     , HTIMESTC
                     , CPERFIL
                     , CUSERID
                     , HTIMEST
                 INTO
                       :SWCD8101-CCODMSG
                     , :SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
                     , :SWCD8101-GMSG
                     , :SWCD8101-ILIDO
                     , :SWCD8101-CPERFILC
                     , :SWCD8101-CUSERIDC
                     , :SWCD8101-HTIMESTC
                     , :SWCD8101-CPERFIL
                     , :SWCD8101-CUSERID
                     , :SWCD8101-HTIMEST
                 FROM SWVT8101
                WHERE CCODMSG = :SWCD8101-CCODMSG
                  AND ZMSGORD = :SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8101               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
      **R        IF VIAL0001-CRIACAO
      *RR           MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
      *RR             TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
      *RR           MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
      *RR             TO SWCV5011-CCODMSG-S
      *RR           MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-EXISTS
      *RR             TO SWCV5011-CCODMSG-MSG
      *RR           MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
      *RR             TO SWCV5011-CCODMSG-CAPLIC
      *RR          CONTINUE
      *RR       ELSE
                    MOVE SWCD8101-CCODMSG
                      TO SWCV5011-CCHAVE
                    MOVE SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
                      TO SWCV5011-ZMSGORD
                    MOVE SWCD8101-GMSG
                      TO SWCV5011-GMSG
                    MOVE SWCD8101-ILIDO
                      TO SWCV5011-ILIDO
                    MOVE SWCD8101-CPERFILC
                      TO SWCV5011-CPERFILC
                    MOVE SWCD8101-CUSERIDC
                      TO SWCV5011-CUSERIDC
                    MOVE SWCD8101-HTIMESTC
                      TO SWCV5011-HTIMESTC
                    IF SWCD8101-ILIDO EQUAL 'S'
                       MOVE SWCD8101-CPERFIL
                         TO SWCV5011-CPERFIL
                       MOVE SWCD8101-CUSERID
                         TO SWCV5011-CUSERID
                       MOVE SWCD8101-HTIMEST
                         TO SWCV5011-HTIMEST
                    ELSE
                       MOVE SPACES         TO SWCV5011-CPERFIL
                                              SWCV5011-CUSERID
                                              SWCV5011-HTIMEST
                    END-IF
                    IF NOT VIAL0001-VISUALIZACAO
                        CONTINUE
                    END-IF
      **R        END-IF
              ELSE
                 IF NOT VIAL0001-CRIACAO
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5011-CCHAVE-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5011-CCHAVE-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5011-CCHAVE-CAPLIC
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SQLCODE' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE SQLCODE TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              MOVE 'SWCV5011-CUSERID' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(2)
              MOVE SWCV5011-CUSERID TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5011-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5011-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5011-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
